sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor customer as Customer
  participant checkout as Checkout API
  participant inventory as Inventory Service
  participant fulfillment as Fulfillment Queue

  link checkout: API runbook @ https://example.test/checkout
  Note over customer,checkout: The customer starts a new order
  customer->>+checkout: [submit_order] Submit order
  checkout->>inventory: [reserve_inventory] Reserve inventory
  alt Inventory is available
    inventory-->>checkout: [inventory_reserved] Inventory reserved
    opt Payment is authorized
      checkout->>fulfillment: [enqueue_fulfillment] Enqueue fulfillment
      activate fulfillment
      loop Retry delivery until accepted
        fulfillment-->>checkout: [delivery_status] Report delivery status
      end
      deactivate fulfillment
    end
  else Inventory is unavailable
    inventory-->>checkout: [inventory_rejected] Reject order
  end
  Note right of checkout: Unaddressed messages and notes stay as context
  checkout-->>-customer: Order processing complete
